flowchart LR
    Group[DrawingComponentGroup] --> Validate[Closed P1/P2/P3/P4/P5 domain validation]
    Canvas[Canvas and DPI] --> Scale[Physical pixel scale]
    Validate --> Surface[Supersampled RGBA surface]
    Scale --> Surface
    Style[DrawingStyle] --> Surface
    Assets[RasterImageAsset] --> Surface
    Curves[Shared arc and Bezier samples] --> Surface
    Paths[Validated linear path subpaths] --> Surface
    Font[Resolved font file and point scale] --> Surface
    Surface --> Composite[Ordered source-over compositing]
    Composite --> Reduce[LANCZOS reduction]
    Reduce --> PNG[Deterministic RGBA PNG]
    PNG --> Result[RasterRenderResult]
    Result --> Pair[RasterBairdResult]
    Result --> Baird[Baird degradation]
    Params[BairdParams and seed] --> Baird
    Substrate[Explicit RGB substrate] --> Baird
    Baird --> Scan[Opaque degraded PNG]
    Scan --> Pair
